## Scope

This result does not eliminate a new H6 cell by itself. The explicit generic-H6 endpoint remains

\[
3874=3076\,C_7+798\,(C_3\sqcup C_4).
\]

The next direct reduction still requires exact state-specific forced-sign extraction, the full affine domination branch-and-bound, or nonlinear sine-cycle exclusion. Reciprocal-collinearity walls remain separate. C-II remains open.
